{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1373795-the-abhartach-crossover-bloodline","id":1373795,"title":"The Abhartach (crossover bloodline)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-03-09T11:51:19-07:00","id":1373795,"title":"The Abhartach (crossover bloodline)","content":"I'm GMing a game for Ordo Dracul PCs, and they are entering stepping on some other splats toes because of Wyrm Nest hunting. One of my PCs was looking for a good crossover bloodline for Vampire-Changeling and we researched a lot. I already created some material, as seen on my signature, the Kiasyd, but the player didn't like them. So, after reading various posts and the new book(Spilled Blood), we created a Ordo Dracul bloodline.<br /> <br /> Here is the link for it: <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1BqrQPuHBNa4635Tac_4UQM3mbVevQUAdrkvrbdKJWNM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-size:20px\">The Abhartach</span></b></a><br /> <br /> I took heavy inspiration on the Keijukainen from Falco1029, and I thank him for the permission to publish my material for you guys.<br /> I hope you guys like it as much as I did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/ma